        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Fix potential race condition in MPTCP path manager timer by rescheduling if socket is locked by user space.",
        "what": "Added a check in mptcp_pm_add_timer to acquire the socket lock (bh_lock_sock) and if the socket is owned by user space (sock_owned_by_user), reschedule the timer after a short delay (HZ/20) and jump to the out label.",
        "how": "Prevents the timer callback from proceeding with signal address logic when the socket is in use by user space, deferring the work to avoid race conditions or deadlocks."
      }
    },
