        "hunk_index": 1,
        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Fix missing socket unlock in mptcp_pm_add_timer timer callback to avoid lock imbalance.",
        "what": "Added `bh_unlock_sock(sk);` call before `__sock_put(sk);` in the 'out:' label of `mptcp_pm_add_timer`.",
        "how": "The function now releases the socket lock (taken in BH context) before decrementing the socket reference count, preventing a lock leak."
